Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.51,0:00:05.29,TL,,0,0,0,,上海大师赛{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}8{\fs68}决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.29,0:00:06.60,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}12{\fs68}号种子霍达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.60,0:00:08.78,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:11.10,TL,,0,0,0,,逆转范德赞德舒尔普
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.01,0:00:13.56,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘两人一路保发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.56,0:00:16.24,TL,,0,0,0,,霍达尔在抢七里{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68}丢掉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.21,0:00:19.78,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘首局 范德赞德舒尔普发球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.78,0:00:23.02,TL,,0,0,0,,霍达尔拿到两个破发点 却都没兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.47,0:00:25.72,TL,,0,0,0,,西班牙媒体报道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.72,0:00:28.23,TL,,0,0,0,,他要求球童递毛巾时用了粗口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.23,0:00:31.51,TL,,0,0,0,,转播随后打出违反体育道德的判罚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.33,0:00:34.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yo entiendo, pero así no.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我理解 但不能这样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.21,0:00:37.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Rafa, pídemelo a mí, y yo se lo pido.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拉法 向我要 我再让他拿给你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.19,0:00:40.21,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}No puedo repetir, tú sabes lo que dijiste.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我不能重复 你知道自己说了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.51,0:00:41.69,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}No puedo repetir ahora.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我现在不能重复
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.82,0:00:44.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Así no. Así no hablamos con ellos.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不行 我们不能这样跟球童说话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:46.36,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yo te entiendo perfectamente, pero eso no.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我完全理解你 但那样不行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.87,0:00:47.36,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Gracias.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:49.21,TL,,0,0,0,,报道还记录了他的抱怨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.21,0:00:50.77,TL,,0,0,0,,球童没有理他
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.77,0:00:54.08,TL,,0,0,0,,主裁的回应是 不能这样跟他们说话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:57.40,TL,,0,0,0,,转播打出的判罚是违反体育道德
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.40,0:00:58.49,TL,,0,0,0,,按 {\fs78}ATP{\fs68} 规则
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.49,0:01:01.33,TL,,0,0,0,,球员须尊重官员 对手 观众和他人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.33,0:01:04.58,TL,,0,0,0,,脏话另有条款 最高罚{\fs78}5000{\fs68}美元
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:08.56,TL,,0,0,0,,比赛中按罚分阶梯处理 第一次警告
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.56,0:01:11.17,TL,,0,0,0,,第二次罚一分 第三次起罚一局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.17,0:01:12.12,TL,,0,0,0,,至于罚款
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.12,0:01:14.11,TL,,0,0,0,,只有一家西班牙电视台报道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.11,0:01:15.84,TL,,0,0,0,,官方没有确认
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.40,0:01:18.67,TL,,0,0,0,,随后他完成破发
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.67,0:01:20.69,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}扳回
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.79,0:01:24.03,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.03,0:01:26.47,TL,,0,0,0,,两个半小时 他晋级八强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.47,0:01:28.68,TL,,0,0,0,,这段场边采访 他只谈比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.68,0:01:30.74,TL,,0,0,0,,没有回应毛巾风波
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:37.28,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So very, very happy how the match went for me today.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N今天比赛打成这样 我非常高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.52,0:01:40.01,TL,,0,0,0,,今年法网 一段球童失衡的视频
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.01,0:01:41.87,TL,,0,0,0,,也让他卷入争议
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.62,0:01:48.84,TL,,0,0,0,,他在发布会上否认碰到球童
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.84,0:01:52.17,TL,,0,0,0,,并解释她是后退时被场边盖布绊到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.42,0:01:55.96,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2016{\fs68}年法网首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.96,0:01:58.12,TL,,0,0,0,,克耶高斯大声冲球童要毛巾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.12,0:02:00.42,TL,,0,0,0,,被主裁拉莫斯判了警告
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.46,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2015{\fs68}年温网 德约冲球童吼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.46,0:02:08.93,TL,,0,0,0,,事后道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.72,0:02:10.90,TL,,0,0,0,,同年在蒙特利尔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.90,0:02:12.73,TL,,0,0,0,,克耶高斯对球童出言不当
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.73,0:02:15.44,TL,,0,0,0,,被追加罚款{\fs78}2500{\fs68}美元
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.92,0:02:20.07,TL,,0,0,0,,下一场 他能把火气留给对手吗？
